  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Her: Shattering Taboos, Far West, Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to empower adolescent girls in Dilasaini rural municipality by providing menstrual health education, enhancing access to hygiene resources, and combating stigma. It includes training on sanitary pad kits, installing dispensers in schools and communities, conducting awareness campaigns, and addressing harmful traditions. With 50% of the funding support from the rural municipality&apos;s government, the project aims to improve girls&apos; school attendance by addressing social barriers.</narrative>
  </description>
